Package: pulzr-wireguard
Provides: parkeze-wireguard
Replaces: parkeze-wireguard
Conflicts: parkeze-wireguard
Depends: pulzr-base, kmod-wireguard, wireguard-tools, ip-full, curl, ca-bundle, jsonfilter
Maintainer: Joseph Telaak <joseph@pulzr.net>
Architecture: all
Description: WireGuard management tunnel, pinned to the wired path.
 Dials out to the Pulzar Cloud WireGuard hub so the cloud can reach this
 gateway's console and SSH directly. The keypair is generated on the gateway
 and its private half never leaves; the tunnel is confined to the ethernet WAN
 so that it can never run over metered cellular.
